<i>♪ Where we ought to be ♪</i>


01:42:17.123 --> 01:42:21.419
<i>♪ And when we find ourselves ♪</i>


01:42:21.502 --> 01:42:28.509
<i>♪ In the place just right ♪</i>


01:42:32.931 --> 01:42:36.768
<i>♪ To bow and to bend ♪</i>


01:42:36.851 --> 01:42:41.314
<i>♪ We shan't be ♪</i>


